@page "/services"

<PageTitle>House Proud Cleaning Solutions - Services</PageTitle>

<section class="hero">
    <h1>Our Cleaning Services</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
        Whatever the job, we've got you covered. Explore our range of residential
        and commercial cleaning services below.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="card-grid">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🏠</div>
            <h3>Maintenance Cleans</h3>
            <p>Weekly or biweekly visits to keep your home fresh. Every visit includes a kitchen and
            bathroom reset, dusting, polishing and surfaces refreshed, plus floors vacuumed and mopped.
            Clients provide their own vacuum and mop/bucket, and add-ons are available on request.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🧹</div>
            <h3>Deep Cleans</h3>
            <p>Includes all standard maintenance tasks plus a deep clean of the kitchen and bathroom
            with a focus on grout and tiles (degreasing and limescale removal), skirting boards and
            door frames, and interior windows. Specific tasks are discussed when your quote is provided.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="text-align:center;">
    <h2>Not Sure What You Need?</h2>
    <p>Get in touch and we'll put together a cleaning plan tailored just for you. Ask about our
    £5 off offer for your first clean!</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Request a Quote</a>
</section>
